     A* Simple (non-join) logical file: PFILE, field selection, keys.
     A* Member: LFPFILE   Compilable: yes (given PERSON and PERSON2)
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for physical and logical files
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* PFILE names the physical file this format is based on.
00010A          R PERSFMT                   PFILE(PERSON)
00020A            PERSONID
00030A            LASTNAME
00040A            AGE
00050A          K LASTNAME
     A*
     A* PFILE may name several physical files sharing the format.
00060A          R MULTIFMT                  PFILE(PERSON PERSON2)
00070A            PERSONID
00080A          K PERSONID
     A*
     A* Key ordering keywords apply to the preceding key field.
00090A          R KEYFMT                    PFILE(PERSON)
00100A            PERSONID
00110A            LASTNAME
00120A            AGE
00130A          K LASTNAME
00140A          K AGE                       DESCEND
00150A          K PERSONID                  ABSVAL
     A*
     A* File-level keywords controlling the access path.
00160A                                      UNIQUE
00170A                                      FIFO
00180A                                      DYNSLT
00190A                                      REFACCPTH(PERSONLIB/PERSON)
     A*
     A* Field-level keywords.
00200A          R FLDKWD                    PFILE(PERSON)
00210A            NEWNAME                   RENAME(LASTNAME)
00220A            FULLNAME                  CONCAT(FIRSTNAME LASTNAME)
00230A            INITIAL                   SST(FIRSTNAME 1 1)
00240A            AGE                       COLHDG('Age' 'Years')
00250A            SALARY                    EDTCDE(J)
00260A            BONUS                     EDTWRD('  $0.  ')
00270A            NOTES                     TEXT('Free form notes')
00280A            CODE                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_CODE)
